---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Fix DroidDeck Insufficient Disk Space — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="How much storage DroidDeck needs and how to fix insufficient disk space errors."
  page="troubleshooting"

  locale="en"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px;max-width:820px}
    .fix-section{margin-bottom:42px}
    .fix-section h2{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .fix-section p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}
    .fix-section ol{padding-left:22px;font-size:15px;color:#43576c;line-height:1.9}
    .fix-section li{margin:10px 0}
    .storage-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;font-size:13px;margin-top:16px}
    .storage-table th,.storage-table td{padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}
    .storage-table th{background:#f4f7fa;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted)}
    .tag-list{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
    .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#f0f7fc;color:#147cb9}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Troubleshooting</div>
        <h1>Insufficient disk space</h1>
        <p>DroidDeck setup or game install fails because your device is running out of storage.</p>
        <div class="tag-list">
          <span class="tag">Storage</span>
          <span class="tag">Setup</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div class="fix-section">
        <h2>How much space you need</h2>
        <table class="storage-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Item</th>
              <th>Minimum space</th>
              <th>Recommended</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>DroidDeck base environment</td>
              <td>~3 GB</td>
              <td>4 GB</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Optional desktop environment</td>
              <td>~2 GB</td>
              <td>3 GB</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Small indie game</td>
              <td>1–3 GB</td>
              <td>2× install size</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>AAA game</td>
              <td>50–100 GB</td>
              <td>Install size + 20 GB free</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="fix-section">
        <h2>Step-by-step fixes</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Free up space before installing.</strong> Steam downloads need extra space during extraction. Keep at least 20% of your storage free.</li>
          <li><strong>Use external storage if available.</strong> Some devices allow moving the DroidDeck container or Steam library to an SD card or USB drive.</li>
          <li><strong>Skip the desktop environment.</strong> If you only need Steam, don't install the optional Linux desktop to save several gigabytes.</li>
          <li><strong>Clear Steam download cache.</strong> Failed downloads can leave partial files behind. Clear the cache in Steam settings.</li>
          <li><strong>Uninstall games you don't play.</strong> Use Steam's library manager to remove large games and reclaim space.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
